WEBVTT

00:26:58.577 --> 00:27:00.577
And we see examples like that,

00:27:00.601 --> 00:27:03.168
so people are concerned,

00:27:03.192 --> 00:27:05.109
maybe they don't have that much privacy,

00:27:05.133 --> 00:27:08.121
and maybe things can get exposed
one way or another,

00:27:08.145 --> 00:27:10.439
then they are more self-disciplined

00:27:10.463 --> 00:27:14.050
and don't say the things
they shouldn't or wouldn't say.

00:27:14.074 --> 00:27:17.680
Now, the debate is whether
that's good for the society or not.

00:27:17.704 --> 00:27:19.887
While one could say,
hey, that's less freedom,

00:27:19.911 --> 00:27:21.442
that's not the way it should be.

00:27:21.466 --> 00:27:23.720
On the other hand,
people are better-behaved.

00:27:23.744 --> 00:27:24.895
I agree with you,

00:27:24.919 --> 00:27:28.477
we really don't know the implications
of how this would play out

00:27:28.501 --> 00:27:29.924
in the East and West.

00:27:29.948 --> 00:27:34.043
I would say that,
in the areas we're discussing,